      {
        "type": "loc-section",
        "title": "The Campus",
        "images": [
          "PostOffice_night-shot-768x513.jpg"
        ],
        "paragraphs": [
          "The historic Barbara Jordan Post Office at 401 Franklin Street, designed by the same architects as the Houston Astrodome, will be the setting for this year’s hyper-sensorial festival.",
          "The 1.5 million square foot hybrid indoor-outdoor space will house three massive stages with seamless flow between the stages and immersive art installations."
        ]
      },
